Package: embt
Title: Expectile Multiplier Bootstrap Tests for Treatment Effect Heterogeneity
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Haokun", "Lu", email = "hklu25@stu.pku.edu.cn",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Xiaojun", "Song", email = "sxj@gsm.pku.edu.cn",
           role = "aut")
  )
Description: Implements tuning-free two-sample tests of whether treatment and
    control outcome distributions differ only by a location shift. The tests
    use centered expectile processes, Mammen multiplier calibration, optional
    pointwise studentization, and optional fixed-basis covariate adjustment.
    Kolmogorov--Smirnov and Cramer--von Mises statistics are computed jointly.
